`, with `::unbind-failed` stopping at once; `continue-stop` completes on `:stopped` fact / lifecycle gap / `stop-grace-ms` against driver `now`. No clock, no sleep. `stop!` does no I/O (test asserts unbind count 0).\n- **§1 profile**: all 20 rows with exact values; validation delegated to `make-endpoint`, `make-acceptor`, `remote/links`, all before `bind!` (test asserts nothing listened on invalid bounds).\n- **§2.1**: full API surface present; `bind!`/`unbind!` called with exactly the documented `"}]}}
